#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Konteksto {#background}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial demonstrates how to solve a higher-order binary optimization (HOBO) problem using the [Optimization Solver, a Qiskit Function by Q-CTRL Fire Opal](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver). The example demonstrated in this tutorial is an optimization problem designed to find the ground-state energy of a random-bond 156-qubit Ising model possessing cubic terms. The Optimization Solver can be used for general optimization problems that can be defined as an objective function.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng tutorial na ito kung paano lutasin ang isang higher-order binary optimization (HOBO) problem gamit ang [Optimization Solver, isang Qiskit Function ng Q-CTRL Fire Opal](/guides/q-ctrl-optimization-solver). Ang halimbawang ipinakita sa tutorial na ito ay isang optimization problem na dinisenyo upang mahanap ang ground-state energy ng isang random-bond 156-qubit Ising model na may cubic terms. Ang Optimization Solver ay maaaring gamitin para sa pangkalahatang optimization problems na maaaring tukuyin bilang objective function.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Optimization fully automates the hardware-aware implementation steps of solving optimization problems on quantum hardware, and by leveraging [Performance Management](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management) for the quantum execution, it achieves accurate solutions at utility scale. For a detailed summary of the full Optimization Solver workflow and benchmarking results, refer to [the published manuscript](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01743).\n"
msgstr "Ang Optimization ay ganap na nag-automate ng mga hardware-aware implementation steps para sa paglutas ng mga optimization problems sa quantum hardware, at sa pamamagitan ng paggamit ng [Performance Management](/guides/q-ctrl-performance-management) para sa quantum execution, nakakamit nito ang mga tumpak na solusyon sa utility scale. Para sa detalyadong buod ng buong Optimization Solver workflow at mga resulta ng benchmarking, sumangguni sa [inilathala na manuscript](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01743).\n"

