# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Define the problem as an objective function {#step-1-define-the-problem-as-an-objective-function}"
msgstr "Hakbang 1: Tukuyin ang problema bilang objective function {#step-1-define-the-problem-as-an-objective-function}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Optimization Solver accepts either an objective function or a graph as input. In this tutorial, the Ising spin glass minimization problem is defined as an objective function, and it has been tailored for the heavy-hex topology of IBM&reg; devices.\n"
msgstr "Ang Optimization Solver ay tumatanggap ng objective function o graph bilang input. Sa tutorial na ito, ang Ising spin glass minimization problem ay tinukoy bilang objective function, at ito ay inayos para sa heavy-hex topology ng mga IBM&reg; device.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because this objective function contains cubic, quadratic, and linear terms, it falls into the HOBO class of problems, known to be considerably more complicated to solve than conventional quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO) problems.\n"
msgstr "Dahil ang objective function na ito ay naglalaman ng cubic, quadratic, at linear terms, ito ay nabibilang sa HOBO class ng mga problema, na kilalang mas kumplikado kaysa sa mga conventional quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO) problems.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For detailed discussion of the construction of the problem definition and previous results obtained from the Optimization Solver refer to [this technical manuscript](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01743). The problem was originally defined and evaluated as part of a [paper published by Los Alamos National Laboratory](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.00997), and it has been adapted to leverage the full device width of the 156-qubit IBM Quantum Heron processors.\n"
msgstr "Para sa detalyadong talakayan ng konstruksiyon ng problem definition at mga nakaraang resultang nakuha mula sa Optimization Solver, sumangguni sa [technical manuscript na ito](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01743). Ang problema ay orihinal na tinukoy at sinuri bilang bahagi ng isang [paper na inilathala ng Los Alamos National Laboratory](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.00997), at ito ay inangkop upang gamitin ang buong device width ng 156-qubit IBM Quantum Heron processors.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Run the hybrid algorithm using the Fire Opal Optimization Solver {#step-2-run-the-hybrid-algorithm-using-the-fire-opal-optimization-solver}"
msgstr "Hakbang 2: Patakbuhin ang hybrid algorithm gamit ang Fire Opal Optimization Solver {#step-2-run-the-hybrid-algorithm-using-the-fire-opal-optimization-solver}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now use the Optimization Solver Qiskit Function to run the algorithm. Behind the scenes, the Optimization Solver takes care of mapping the problem to a hybrid quantum algorithm, running the quantum circuits with error suppression, and performing the classical optimization.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, gamitin ang Optimization Solver Qiskit Function upang patakbuhin ang algorithm. Sa likod ng eksena, ang Optimization Solver ay nag-aalaga sa pagmamapa ng problema sa isang hybrid quantum algorithm, pinapatakbo ang mga quantum circuit na may error suppression, at gumaganap ng classical optimization.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check to ensure that the chosen device has at least 156 qubits.\n"
msgstr "Suriin upang matiyak na ang napiling device ay may hindi bababa sa 156 qubits.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Solver accepts a string representation of the objective function.\n"
msgstr "Ang Solver ay tumatanggap ng string representation ng objective function.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the familiar [Qiskit Serverless APIs](/guides/serverless) to check your Qiskit Function workload's status:\n"
msgstr "Maaari ninyong gamitin ang pamilyar na [Qiskit Serverless APIs](/guides/serverless) upang suriin ang status ng inyong Qiskit Function workload:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "The Solver returns a dictionary with the solution and associated metadata, such as the solution bitstring, number of iterations, and mapping of variables to bitstring. For a full definition of the Solver's inputs and outputs, check out the [documentation]().\n"
msgid "The Solver returns a dictionary with the solution and associated metadata, such as the solution bitstring, number of iterations, and mapping of variables to bitstring. For a full definition of the Solver's inputs and outputs, check out the [documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-optimization-solver).\n"
msgstr "Ang Solver ay nagbabalik ng dictionary na may solusyon at kaugnay na metadata, tulad ng solution bitstring, bilang ng iterations, at pagmamapa ng mga variable sa bitstring. Para sa buong kahulugan ng mga input at output ng Solver, tingnan ang [dokumentasyon]().\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Evaluate results {#step-3-evaluate-results}"
msgstr "Hakbang 3: Suriin ang mga resulta {#step-3-evaluate-results}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Solver found the correct solution, which was validated using classical optimization software. The complexity of this utility-scale problem requires an advanced optimization software to be solved classically, such as [IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio (CPLEX)](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) or [Gurobi Optimization](https://www.gurobi.com/).\n"
"As a visual analysis of the quality of results, you can plot the results by calculating the cost values from the bitstrings and their probabilities. For comparison, plot the results alongside a distribution of randomly sampled bitstrings, which is equivalent to a \"brute-force\" classical solution. If the algorithm consistently finds lower costs, it suggests the quantum algorithm is effectively solving the optimization problem.\n"
msgstr "Natagpuan ng Solver ang tamang solusyon, na na-validate gamit ang classical optimization software. Ang pagiging kumplikado ng utility-scale problem na ito ay nangangailangan ng advanced optimization software upang malutas nang classically, tulad ng [IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio (CPLEX)](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) o [Gurobi Optimization](https://www.gurobi.com/).\n"

